d><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/ng786</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><fig position="float" id="F1"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Mean of standard deviation of 2&#x003c6; (10,000 iterations).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-6-S1-S34-1"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F2"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Mean of standard deviation of 2&#x003c6; (1,000,000 iterations).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-6-S1-S34-2"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F3"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Information for sibling pairs.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-6-S1-S34-3"/></fig></sec></back></article>